  "ruleText": "Pda 101.17 “Division director” means “division director” as defined in RSA 12-G:2, XI, namely, “the director of the division of ports and harbors.”\n\nSource. #7847, eff 3-8-03; renumbered by #8298 (from Pda 101.14); ss and moved by #8760, eff 11-18-06 (from Pda 101.12)",
